///|
/// The first 40,000 requests of the ARC OLTP trace, one key per request. The
/// full trace is 914,145 requests over 186,880 keys; the offline test replays
/// this prefix so CI needs no downloaded data. Source: the `arc` directory of
/// the cache-trace dataset described in the ARC paper (FAST 2003).
